[10.029172, "i", "printf '%s\\n' '--- forms.txt ---'; cat /app/vatnotes/forms.txt; printf '%s\\n' '--- BAYMAP.txt ---'; cat /app/vatnotes/BAYMAP.txt\n"]
[10.029988, "o", "printf '%s\\n' '--- forms.txt ---'; cat /app/vatnotes/forms.txt; printf '%s\\n' '--- BAYMAP.txt ---'; cat /app/vatnotes/BAYMAP.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r--- forms.txt ---\r\n"]
[10.032309, "o", "backtrace.txt\r\nEach line is NAME at 0xHHHHHHHH\r\nHex is eight lowercase digits.\r\nWhen a source row exists, the line continues with a space and FILE:LINE.\r\n\r\nprovenance.json\r\n{\r\n  \"objects\": [\r\n    {\"build_id\": \"<id>\", \"host\": \"<well directory name>\"}\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\nobjects are sorted by build_id ascending.\r\n\r\nok.mark\r\nThe bytes o k newline.\r\n\r\n/app/dumpit/shift.core names aabbccdd and eeff0011.\r\nWell directory names under /app/dbgwells: deepwell, fastpit, midquay.\r\nExample splice: /app/bin/ashquay splice /app/dumpit/shift.core /app/outkeg/runA\r\n\r\n"]
[10.032553, "o", "--- BAYMAP.txt ---\r\n"]
[10.033557, "o", "millcue   argv and hull\r\nhopbag    well bag\r\nobjbay    object pick\r\nribvat    provenance writer\r\nsidelog   contact log\r\ncardurn   cards\r\ndbgwells  debug objects\r\ndumpit    dumps\r\nvatnotes  this map\r\n"]
[10.033756, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@e9f94d65e3e8:/app# "]
